{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1739664000, "end_date": 1740355199, "month_true_total": 303, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:53:07 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "188618171", "author": {"steamid": "76561199002150479", "personaname": "SleepyAl93", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sleepychickenchecker/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3673, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 396, "last_played": 1766698882, "avatar": "6527688890b5b7ff38c4315c71fc1730c97687d2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Obviously when I got this game I was expecting a successor to Left 4 Dead, as it was being billed when it originally came out. It's not. Not even close. But it is a fun shooter, and has provided me with hours of fun playing with my friends who can't play Left 4 Dead 1 or 2 on their console with me. So I'd still recommend it.", "timestamp_created": 1740350269, "timestamp_updated": 1740350269, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188617959", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088206502", "personaname": "Anders", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Aseneekiwaka/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 177, "playtime_forever": 3584, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1211, "last_played": 1745628474, "avatar": "3e0c5d40f17e245339021ed202f361e783fc9307"}, "language": "english", "review": "kf3 is so ass\r\nit makes back4blood a better game", "timestamp_created": 1740350032, "timestamp_updated": 1740350032, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.530201315879821777", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188603756", "author": {"steamid": "76561198209765351", "personaname": "Swe4ty P4nther", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198209765351/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 660, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 249, "last_played": 1742148860, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun af!", "timestamp_created": 1740336612, "timestamp_updated": 1740336612, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188581329", "author": {"steamid": "76561198801479581", "personaname": "Cygen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NetanyahusGreatestSoldier/", "num_games_owned": 283, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 19816, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19816, "last_played": 1766386183, "avatar": "75ded615db8b359291df52611954872df82712b6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Back 4 Blood tries to capture the magic of Left 4 Dead 2, and while it gets some things right, it overcomplicates what made its predecessor great. The gunplay is solid, the environments look great, and the co-op experience can be fun with the right team. However, the game stumbles with its overdesigned mechanics—card-based perks, constant ammo scarcity, and enemy mutations that feel more frustrating than challenging. Instead of the simple, frantic survival of L4D2, you’re constantly micromanaging builds, economy, and objectives that take away from the raw fun of blasting through hordes.\n\nThe biggest issue is the zombie design. Special Ridden feel excessive, with many of them being bullet sponges that slow the pacing rather than making encounters dynamic. Where L4D2 had a perfect balance of chaos and simplicity, Back 4 Blood feels like it’s trying too hard to be something more complex. It’s still enjoyable, especially with friends, but it lacks the pick-up-and-play magic that made its spiritual predecessor a timeless classic. If you’re looking for a more structured and tactical co-op shooter, it’s worth a try—but if you just want classic, chaotic zombie survival, you might find yourself going back to Left 4 Dead 2 instead.", "timestamp_created": 1740318355, "timestamp_updated": 1740318355, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 52, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.736943364143371582", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "188576844", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057574744", "personaname": "Gangstarr324", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198057574744/", "num_games_owned": 65, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1310, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 330, "last_played": 1746300371, "avatar": "81aa28343e05aa4319483c18c367ea40aac37c64"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is an awesome experience and I felt like a kid again playing with my childhood friend remembering L4D1.\r\nIt raises to the level of L4D and L4D2.\r\n\r\nAwesome, awesome!", "timestamp_created": 1740314618, "timestamp_updated": 1740314618, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}